-- Szarfa (COSTUME_ACCE) combine ("kombinacja") and absorb ("przechwytywanie
-- bonusow") windows, moved onto Uriel (NPC 20011) as proper quest chat
-- options -- operator's explicit request, 17 September 2026. Previously
-- these were only reachable via the GM-only /acce c and /acce a commands
-- (added earlier the same day after acce_costume_test.quest's own NPC menu
-- options overflowed NPC 20001's combined chat menu, see custom-patches/
-- README.md's ACCE section) -- those GM commands stay in place unchanged,
-- this quest adds a real player-facing path alongside them.
--
-- Uses pc.open_acce(bool), an existing Lua binding (questlua_pc.cpp,
-- ALUA(pc_open_acce), gated ENABLE_ACCE_COSTUME_SYSTEM, already on) that
-- calls CHARACTER::OpenAcce() directly -- the exact same C++ entry point
-- the GM commands use. No new C++ was written for this quest.
--
-- NPC 20011 (Uriel) had exactly one other quest touching it before this
-- (new_quest_lv19.quest, two mutually-exclusive per-player states of the
-- same killanimals chat trigger) -- confirmed via grep across game/quest/
-- before adding this, to stay well clear of the menu-overflow bug found and
-- fixed for NPC 20001 earlier the same day.
--
-- MT2009_PLUS_SASH_CLOTH_V1 (the owner, 6 October): "Wytwarzanie" - Uriel's
-- crafting window (number 111, CRAFTING_URIEL), the same window Kowal and the
-- others open (libs/crafting, crafting_manage handles its "craft create"). It
-- lists the recipes of crafting_data[111] (the Dockerfile adds it to
-- crafting_data.lua; world.crafting_proto 85001): 10 Delikatne Sukno (80019,
-- dropped by Metins and bosses in place of the +0 sash) and 80 000 yang make the
-- plain sash, Szarfa Wladcy +0 (85001), at 100%. The Seban panel's "Wytwarzanie
-- przedmiotow" edits the window like the others.
--
-- MT2009_PLUS_TEOWADEN_V1 (the owner, 14 October 2026: "dodaj w koncu
-- Teowadena w miejscach z wiki, ze WSZYSTKIMI opcjami szarf przeniesionymi
-- z Uriela"): every sash option above moved from Uriel (20011) to
-- Theowahdan (60003, the pl-wiki's name; the race scholar_beige_M1) - the
-- crafting window 111, the combine and the absorb windows, the same
-- behaviour, Uriel keeps only his own quests (new_quest_lv19). Theowahdan
-- stands where the pl-wiki puts him: Yongan 732,480, Joan 681,717, Pyungmoo
-- 413,539 and Przyladek Smoczego Ognia 563,1167 (game/Dockerfile, the
-- MT2009_PLUS_TEOWADEN_V1 step) and Dongan 588,761 (yohara_maps, Owsap's
-- npc.txt). crafting.lua ties window 111 to the vid the player talks to, not
-- to a race, so nothing else changes. The quest keeps its name - the Seban
-- panel's crafting and quest editors know it by it.
quest acce_costume_uriel begin
	state start begin
		when 60003.chat."Wytwarzanie" begin
			crafting.open(111)
			setskin(NOWINDOW)
		end
		when 60003.chat."Polacz Szarfy" begin
			say_title(mob_name(60003))
			say("Przynies dwie Szarfy tego samego stopnia, a polacze je w jedna, silniejsza.")
			pc.open_acce(true)
		end
		when 60003.chat."Przechwyc bonus do Szarfy" begin
			say_title(mob_name(60003))
			say("Przynies Szarfe oraz przedmiot, z ktorego chcesz przechwycic bonus.")
			pc.open_acce(false)
		end
	end
end
